#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "Execution Order 7-R"
msgstr "[Éxéçúťíóñ Óŕďéŕ 7-Ŕ~~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "A voice reading numbers. Yours, you think. \"Subject non-viable. Recover the core. Discard the rest.\" Someone laughed when the lights went out."
msgstr "[Á vóíçé ŕéáďíñğ ñúmbéŕš. Ýóúŕš, ýóú ťĥíñķ. \"Šúbĵéçť ñóñ-víábĺé. Ŕéçóvéŕ ťĥé çóŕé. Ďíšçáŕď ťĥé ŕéšť.\" Šóméóñé ĺáúğĥéď ŵĥéñ ťĥé ĺíğĥťš ŵéñť óúť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "Rain Clinic"
msgstr "[Ŕáíñ Çĺíñíç~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "A hand on your chest, where the scar is now. \"It runs on something it shouldn't. Every time it spikes, you'll lose a little more of whatever it's eating.\""
msgstr "[Á ĥáñď óñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť, ŵĥéŕé ťĥé šçáŕ íš ñóŵ. \"Íť ŕúñš óñ šóméťĥíñğ íť šĥóúĺďñ'ť. Évéŕý ťímé íť špíķéš, ýóú'ĺĺ ĺóšé á ĺíťťĺé móŕé óf ŵĥáťévéŕ íť'š éáťíñğ.\"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "The Warden's Ledger"
msgstr "[Ťĥé Ŵáŕďéñ'š Ĺéďğéŕ~~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "Krail's handwriting, neat as a verdict: \"Everything pulled from the Spire passes through my tower. Everything. That includes the ones they call REDLINE.\""
msgstr "[Ķŕáíĺ'š ĥáñďŵŕíťíñğ, ñéáť áš á véŕďíçť: \"Évéŕýťĥíñğ púĺĺéď fŕóm ťĥé Špíŕé páššéš ťĥŕóúğĥ mý ťóŵéŕ. Évéŕýťĥíñğ. Ťĥáť íñçĺúďéš ťĥé óñéš ťĥéý çáĺĺ ŔÉĎĹÍÑÉ.\"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "Cell Four"
msgstr "[Çéĺĺ Fóúŕ~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "Rain through a crack in the ceiling. Someone in the next cell taps the pipe: three short, three long. A guard laughs. \"Save it. This one came in without a name. The tag just says SPIRE.\""
msgstr "[Ŕáíñ ťĥŕóúğĥ á çŕáçķ íñ ťĥé çéíĺíñğ. Šóméóñé íñ ťĥé ñéxť çéĺĺ ťápš ťĥé pípé: ťĥŕéé šĥóŕť, ťĥŕéé ĺóñğ. Á ğúáŕď ĺáúğĥš. \"Šávé íť. Ťĥíš óñé çámé íñ ŵíťĥóúť á ñámé. Ťĥé ťáğ ĵúšť šáýš ŠPÍŔÉ.\"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "It Won't Come Out"
msgstr "[Íť Ŵóñ'ť Çómé Óúť~~~~~~]"

#: data/lore/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "Cold steel under your back. Gloved hands on your chest, pulling. Something inside pulls back harder. \"It won't come out.\" A long pause. \"Then leave it in him. The Collector can take both.\""
msgstr "[Çóĺď šťééĺ úñďéŕ ýóúŕ báçķ. Ğĺóvéď ĥáñďš óñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť, púĺĺíñğ. Šóméťĥíñğ íñšíďé púĺĺš báçķ ĥáŕďéŕ. \"Íť ŵóñ'ť çómé óúť.\" Á ĺóñğ páúšé. \"Ťĥéñ ĺéávé íť íñ ĥím. Ťĥé Çóĺĺéçťóŕ çáñ ťáķé bóťĥ.\"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres
msgid "Count the Last One"
msgstr "[Çóúñť ťĥé Ĺášť Óñé~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres
msgid "The last car has no markings. Its doors are welded shut."
msgstr "[Ťĥé ĺášť çáŕ ĥáš ñó máŕķíñğš. Íťš ďóóŕš áŕé ŵéĺďéď šĥúť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres
msgid "Night. A bridge over the rail yards. Wind in the railings."
msgstr "[Ñíğĥť. Á bŕíďğé óvéŕ ťĥé ŕáíĺ ýáŕďš. Ŵíñď íñ ťĥé ŕáíĺíñğš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres
msgid "Someone beside you counts the cars under their breath."
msgstr "[Šóméóñé béšíďé ýóú çóúñťš ťĥé çáŕš úñďéŕ ťĥéíŕ bŕéáťĥ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres data/memories/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "VOICE"
msgstr "[VÓÍÇÉ~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres
msgid "Always count the last one twice."
msgstr "[Áĺŵáýš çóúñť ťĥé ĺášť óñé ťŵíçé.~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mem_first_rest.tres
msgid "You turn to ask why. Where their face should be, there's only static."
msgstr "[Ýóú ťúŕñ ťó ášķ ŵĥý. Ŵĥéŕé ťĥéíŕ fáçé šĥóúĺď bé, ťĥéŕé'š óñĺý šťáťíç.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "MEMORY"
msgstr "[MÉMÓŔÝ~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Rest at an Anchor to remember."
msgstr "[Ŕéšť áť áñ Áñçĥóŕ ťó ŕémémbéŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Open the Journal to remember."
msgstr "[Ópéñ ťĥé Ĵóúŕñáĺ ťó ŕémémbéŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Another memory is waiting."
msgstr "[Áñóťĥéŕ mémóŕý íš ŵáíťíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Fragments remembered {seen} / {total}"
msgstr "[Fŕáğméñťš ŕémémbéŕéď {seen} / {total}~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Memories…"
msgstr "[Mémóŕíéš…~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "No memories recovered."
msgstr "[Ñó mémóŕíéš ŕéçóvéŕéď.~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "MEMORIES  —  ACT {act}"
msgstr "[MÉMÓŔÍÉŠ  —  ÁÇŤ {act}~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "— rest at an Anchor"
msgstr "[— ŕéšť áť áñ Áñçĥóŕ~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Detail: {detail}"
msgstr "[Ďéťáíĺ: {detail}~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Something else was there."
msgstr "[Šóméťĥíñğ éĺšé ŵáš ťĥéŕé.~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres ui/menus/AchievementsMenu.gd ui/menus/ChallengesMenu.gd ui/menus/JournalMenu.gd ui/menus/LoadoutMenu.gd ui/menus/NgPlusMenu.gd ui/menus/SettingsMenu.gd ui/menus/TitleMenu.gd
msgid "Back"
msgstr "[Báçķ~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres ui/menus/PauseMenu.gd
msgid "PAUSED"
msgstr "[PÁÚŠÉĎ~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres ui/menus/PauseMenu.gd
msgid "Resume"
msgstr "[Ŕéšúmé~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Skip memory"
msgstr "[Šķíp mémóŕý~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres
msgid "Subtitle size: {size}"
msgstr "[Šúbťíťĺé šížé: {size}~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres data/settings/pages/subtitles.tres
msgid "Small"
msgstr "[Šmáĺĺ~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres data/settings/pages/subtitles.tres
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "[Méďíúm~~~]"

#: data/memories/memory_config.tres data/settings/pages/subtitles.tres
msgid "Large"
msgstr "[Ĺáŕğé~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "The order is signed. The signature is red static. It won't come into focus."
msgstr "[Ťĥé óŕďéŕ íš šíğñéď. Ťĥé šíğñáťúŕé íš ŕéď šťáťíç. Íť ŵóñ'ť çómé íñťó fóçúš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "A voice reading numbers. Yours, you think."
msgstr "[Á vóíçé ŕéáďíñğ ñúmbéŕš. Ýóúŕš, ýóú ťĥíñķ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "READER"
msgstr "[ŔÉÁĎÉŔ~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "Subject non-viable."
msgstr "[Šúbĵéçť ñóñ-víábĺé.~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "Recover the core. Discard the rest."
msgstr "[Ŕéçóvéŕ ťĥé çóŕé. Ďíšçáŕď ťĥé ŕéšť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_01.tres
msgid "The lights go out. Someone laughs."
msgstr "[Ťĥé ĺíğĥťš ğó óúť. Šóméóñé ĺáúğĥš.~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "On the tray, a second dressing the shape of your scar. Already used."
msgstr "[Óñ ťĥé ťŕáý, á šéçóñď ďŕéššíñğ ťĥé šĥápé óf ýóúŕ šçáŕ. Áĺŕéáďý úšéď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "Rain on a tin roof. A lamp with a green shade."
msgstr "[Ŕáíñ óñ á ťíñ ŕóóf. Á ĺámp ŵíťĥ á ğŕééñ šĥáďé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "A hand on your chest, where the scar is now."
msgstr "[Á ĥáñď óñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť, ŵĥéŕé ťĥé šçáŕ íš ñóŵ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "It runs on something it shouldn't."
msgstr "[Íť ŕúñš óñ šóméťĥíñğ íť šĥóúĺďñ'ť.~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_02.tres
msgid "Every time it spikes, you'll lose a little more of whatever it's eating."
msgstr "[Évéŕý ťímé íť špíķéš, ýóú'ĺĺ ĺóšé á ĺíťťĺé móŕé óf ŵĥáťévéŕ íť'š éáťíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "Your line in the ledger has no name. Only SPIRE, and a date the rain has smeared."
msgstr "[Ýóúŕ ĺíñé íñ ťĥé ĺéďğéŕ ĥáš ñó ñámé. Óñĺý ŠPÍŔÉ, áñď á ďáťé ťĥé ŕáíñ ĥáš šméáŕéď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "Lamplight on a steel desk. You see it from the floor."
msgstr "[Ĺámpĺíğĥť óñ á šťééĺ ďéšķ. Ýóú šéé íť fŕóm ťĥé fĺóóŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "Krail's handwriting, neat as a verdict:"
msgstr "[Ķŕáíĺ'š ĥáñďŵŕíťíñğ, ñéáť áš á véŕďíçť:~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "LEDGER"
msgstr "[ĹÉĎĞÉŔ~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "Everything pulled from the Spire passes through my tower. Everything."
msgstr "[Évéŕýťĥíñğ púĺĺéď fŕóm ťĥé Špíŕé páššéš ťĥŕóúğĥ mý ťóŵéŕ. Évéŕýťĥíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_03.tres
msgid "That includes the ones they call REDLINE."
msgstr "[Ťĥáť íñçĺúďéš ťĥé óñéš ťĥéý çáĺĺ ŔÉĎĹÍÑÉ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "The tapping never finishes. Three short, three long, then nothing."
msgstr "[Ťĥé ťáppíñğ ñévéŕ fíñíšĥéš. Ťĥŕéé šĥóŕť, ťĥŕéé ĺóñğ, ťĥéñ ñóťĥíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "Rain through a crack in the ceiling."
msgstr "[Ŕáíñ ťĥŕóúğĥ á çŕáçķ íñ ťĥé çéíĺíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "Someone in the next cell taps the pipe: three short, three long."
msgstr "[Šóméóñé íñ ťĥé ñéxť çéĺĺ ťápš ťĥé pípé: ťĥŕéé šĥóŕť, ťĥŕéé ĺóñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "GUARD"
msgstr "[ĞÚÁŔĎ~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "Save it."
msgstr "[Šávé íť.~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_lowlight_04.tres
msgid "This one came in without a name. The tag just says SPIRE."
msgstr "[Ťĥíš óñé çámé íñ ŵíťĥóúť á ñámé. Ťĥé ťáğ ĵúšť šáýš ŠPÍŔÉ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "A tag on the tray: UNIT 14. CYCLE 4471. The name field is blank."
msgstr "[Á ťáğ óñ ťĥé ťŕáý: ÚÑÍŤ 14. ÇÝÇĹÉ 4471. Ťĥé ñámé fíéĺď íš bĺáñķ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "Cold steel under your back. A lamp swinging overhead."
msgstr "[Çóĺď šťééĺ úñďéŕ ýóúŕ báçķ. Á ĺámp šŵíñğíñğ óvéŕĥéáď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "Gloved hands on your chest, pulling. Something inside pulls back harder."
msgstr "[Ğĺóvéď ĥáñďš óñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť, púĺĺíñğ. Šóméťĥíñğ íñšíďé púĺĺš báçķ ĥáŕďéŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "CREW"
msgstr "[ÇŔÉŴ~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "It won't come out."
msgstr "[Íť ŵóñ'ť çómé óúť.~~~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "SUPERVISOR"
msgstr "[ŠÚPÉŔVÍŠÓŔ~~~~~]"

#: data/memories/mf_undercity_01.tres
msgid "Then leave it in him. The Collector can take both."
msgstr "[Ťĥéñ ĺéávé íť íñ ĥím. Ťĥé Çóĺĺéçťóŕ çáñ ťáķé bóťĥ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/iko.tres
msgid "Black Market"
msgstr "[Bĺáçķ Máŕķéť~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/iko.tres data/npcs/mara.tres data/npcs/nix.tres data/npcs/orr.tres data/npcs/vell.tres interactables/NPC.gd
msgid "Talk"
msgstr "[Ťáĺķ~~]"

#: data/npcs/iko.tres
msgid "Easy. You're the one who lit up the grid? Good. Krail's people have been sitting on my canal for a month."
msgstr "[Éášý. Ýóú'ŕé ťĥé óñé ŵĥó ĺíť úp ťĥé ğŕíď? Ğóóď. Ķŕáíĺ'š péópĺé ĥávé bééñ šíťťíñğ óñ mý çáñáĺ fóŕ á móñťĥ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/iko.tres
msgid "Iko. I move what the Wardens don't want moved. I'll set up somewhere safer. That Relay of yours."
msgstr "[Íķó. Í móvé ŵĥáť ťĥé Ŵáŕďéñš ďóñ'ť ŵáñť móvéď. Í'ĺĺ šéť úp šóméŵĥéŕé šáféŕ. Ťĥáť Ŕéĺáý óf ýóúŕš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/iko.tres
msgid "Everything here fell off a Warden truck. Don't ask which one."
msgstr "[Évéŕýťĥíñğ ĥéŕé féĺĺ óff á Ŵáŕďéñ ťŕúçķ. Ďóñ'ť ášķ ŵĥíçĥ óñé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "Mechanic"
msgstr "[Méçĥáñíç~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "Orr says you walked out of a Collector's nest with that thing still burning in you."
msgstr "[Óŕŕ šáýš ýóú ŵáĺķéď óúť óf á Çóĺĺéçťóŕ'š ñéšť ŵíťĥ ťĥáť ťĥíñğ šťíĺĺ búŕñíñğ íñ ýóú.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "You've felt it drink by now. Keep it fed, rest at Anchors, and it'll keep you running. Here. A Scattergun. Up close it solves arguments."
msgstr "[Ýóú'vé féĺť íť ďŕíñķ bý ñóŵ. Ķéép íť féď, ŕéšť áť Áñçĥóŕš, áñď íť'ĺĺ ķéép ýóú ŕúññíñğ. Ĥéŕé. Á Šçáťťéŕğúñ. Úp çĺóšé íť šóĺvéš áŕğúméñťš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "Stop poking the scar. That's a Redline Core, and it is not supposed to be in a person."
msgstr "[Šťóp póķíñğ ťĥé šçáŕ. Ťĥáť'š á Ŕéďĺíñé Çóŕé, áñď íť íš ñóť šúppóšéď ťó bé íñ á péŕšóñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "Out there it burns hot. Fight, move, break things - it drinks what's left and keeps you running."
msgstr "[Óúť ťĥéŕé íť búŕñš ĥóť. Fíğĥť, móvé, bŕéáķ ťĥíñğš - íť ďŕíñķš ŵĥáť'š ĺéfť áñď ķéépš ýóú ŕúññíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "Rest at an Anchor and it settles. Here. A Scattergun. Up close it solves arguments."
msgstr "[Ŕéšť áť áñ Áñçĥóŕ áñď íť šéťťĺéš. Ĥéŕé. Á Šçáťťéŕğúñ. Úp çĺóšé íť šóĺvéš áŕğúméñťš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/mara.tres
msgid "Weapons, fixes, bad advice. Pick one."
msgstr "[Ŵéápóñš, fíxéš, báď áďvíçé. Píçķ óñé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/nix.tres
msgid "You walked it. All of it, near enough. Look at that - the flood lines, the new walls."
msgstr "[Ýóú ŵáĺķéď íť. Áĺĺ óf íť, ñéáŕ éñóúğĥ. Ĺóóķ áť ťĥáť - ťĥé fĺóóď ĺíñéš, ťĥé ñéŵ ŵáĺĺš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/nix.tres
msgid "Seventy years of Lowlight and nobody bothered to redraw it. Here. Your cut, and my old lens."
msgstr "[Šévéñťý ýéáŕš óf Ĺóŵĺíğĥť áñď ñóbóďý bóťĥéŕéď ťó ŕéďŕáŵ íť. Ĥéŕé. Ýóúŕ çúť, áñď mý óĺď ĺéñš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/nix.tres
msgid "Nix. I draw the city. The city keeps redrawing itself, so it's steady work."
msgstr "[Ñíx. Í ďŕáŵ ťĥé çíťý. Ťĥé çíťý ķéépš ŕéďŕáŵíñğ íťšéĺf, šó íť'š šťéáďý ŵóŕķ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/nix.tres
msgid "Lowlight moved twice since the flood. My maps didn't. Walk it for me and I'll fill in the rest."
msgstr "[Ĺóŵĺíğĥť móvéď ťŵíçé šíñçé ťĥé fĺóóď. Mý mápš ďíďñ'ť. Ŵáĺķ íť fóŕ mé áñď Í'ĺĺ fíĺĺ íñ ťĥé ŕéšť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/nix.tres
msgid "Take a look at the stock. The transit pass gets you between Anchors you've rested at."
msgstr "[Ťáķé á ĺóóķ áť ťĥé šťóçķ. Ťĥé ťŕáñšíť pášš ğéťš ýóú béťŵééñ Áñçĥóŕš ýóú'vé ŕéšťéď áť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/nix.tres
msgid "Maps, lenses, tickets. Everything a lost person needs."
msgstr "[Mápš, ĺéñšéš, ťíçķéťš. Évéŕýťĥíñğ á ĺóšť péŕšóñ ñééďš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Radio"
msgstr "[Ŕáďíó~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "A smuggler came up the lift while you were out. Iko. Says you're good for business."
msgstr "[Á šmúğğĺéŕ çámé úp ťĥé ĺífť ŵĥíĺé ýóú ŵéŕé óúť. Íķó. Šáýš ýóú'ŕé ğóóď fóŕ búšíñéšš.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "Somebody lit up the Rainline. My whole board just jumped."
msgstr "[Šómébóďý ĺíť úp ťĥé Ŕáíñĺíñé. Mý ŵĥóĺé bóáŕď ĵúšť ĵúmpéď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "All three? The static's gone. I can hear Warden Krail's patrol codes clear as rain."
msgstr "[Áĺĺ ťĥŕéé? Ťĥé šťáťíç'š ğóñé. Í çáñ ĥéáŕ Ŵáŕďéñ Ķŕáíĺ'š páťŕóĺ çóďéš çĺéáŕ áš ŕáíñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "He's pulling something up the Bell Tower lift every night. Same crates they meant to carry you out in."
msgstr "[Ĥé'š púĺĺíñğ šóméťĥíñğ úp ťĥé Béĺĺ Ťóŵéŕ ĺífť évéŕý ñíğĥť. Šámé çŕáťéš ťĥéý méáñť ťó çáŕŕý ýóú óúť íñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "Take this. Earned it. And Rook - don't go up that tower tired."
msgstr "[Ťáķé ťĥíš. Éáŕñéď íť. Áñď Ŕóóķ - ďóñ'ť ğó úp ťĥáť ťóŵéŕ ťíŕéď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "So you're the one who shut a Collector up. You look worse than I pictured."
msgstr "[Šó ýóú'ŕé ťĥé óñé ŵĥó šĥúť á Çóĺĺéçťóŕ úp. Ýóú ĺóóķ ŵóŕšé ťĥáñ Í píçťúŕéď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "Mara wants a look at that Core. First, though: the Warden's people knocked our repeaters out of line."
msgstr "[Máŕá ŵáñťš á ĺóóķ áť ťĥáť Çóŕé. Fíŕšť, ťĥóúğĥ: ťĥé Ŵáŕďéñ'š péópĺé ķñóçķéď óúŕ ŕépéáťéŕš óúť óf ĺíñé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "Lowlight's full of them. Realign three and this whole Relay stops being deaf. Deal?"
msgstr "[Ĺóŵĺíğĥť'š fúĺĺ óf ťĥém. Ŕéáĺíğñ ťĥŕéé áñď ťĥíš ŵĥóĺé Ŕéĺáý šťópš béíñğ ďéáf. Ďéáĺ?~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "You're awake. Good. Mara said the thing in your chest would either restart you or cook the room."
msgstr "[Ýóú'ŕé áŵáķé. Ğóóď. Máŕá šáíď ťĥé ťĥíñğ íñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť ŵóúĺď éíťĥéŕ ŕéšťáŕť ýóú óŕ çóóķ ťĥé ŕóóm.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr.tres
msgid "I run the radio. Or I did, before the Warden's people knocked our repeaters out of line."
msgstr "[Í ŕúñ ťĥé ŕáďíó. Óŕ Í ďíď, béfóŕé ťĥé Ŵáŕďéñ'š péópĺé ķñóçķéď óúŕ ŕépéáťéŕš óúť óf ĺíñé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres data/npcs/relay_board.tres
msgid "Listen"
msgstr "[Ĺíšťéñ~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Relay here. Nothing on this band but Recovery now. Don't linger."
msgstr "[Ŕéĺáý ĥéŕé. Ñóťĥíñğ óñ ťĥíš báñď búť Ŕéçóvéŕý ñóŵ. Ďóñ'ť ĺíñğéŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "The Collector's gone off the band. Tell me that was you."
msgstr "[Ťĥé Çóĺĺéçťóŕ'š ğóñé óff ťĥé báñď. Ťéĺĺ mé ťĥáť ŵáš ýóú.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Rail line's straight ahead. Top gallery, left side of the Relay. I'll leave the door unjammed."
msgstr "[Ŕáíĺ ĺíñé'š šťŕáíğĥť áĥéáď. Ťóp ğáĺĺéŕý, ĺéfť šíďé óf ťĥé Ŕéĺáý. Í'ĺĺ ĺéávé ťĥé ďóóŕ úñĵámméď.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Top gallery. Keep climbing."
msgstr "[Ťóp ğáĺĺéŕý. Ķéép çĺímbíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Orr, on the old crew band. You came down the back way? Then you know the voice."
msgstr "[Óŕŕ, óñ ťĥé óĺď çŕéŵ báñď. Ýóú çámé ďóŵñ ťĥé báçķ ŵáý? Ťĥéñ ýóú ķñóŵ ťĥé vóíçé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "That bay below you is a Collector's nest. It hunts what's in your chest. Don't stand still near it."
msgstr "[Ťĥáť báý béĺóŵ ýóú íš á Çóĺĺéçťóŕ'š ñéšť. Íť ĥúñťš ŵĥáť'š íñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť. Ďóñ'ť šťáñď šťíĺĺ ñéáŕ íť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Lift shaft, then the Anchor at the top, then the Collector's bay. Don't stop moving."
msgstr "[Ĺífť šĥáfť, ťĥéñ ťĥé Áñçĥóŕ áť ťĥé ťóp, ťĥéñ ťĥé Çóĺĺéçťóŕ'š báý. Ďóñ'ť šťóp móvíñğ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "...is this band live? You by the lift shaft - don't answer. Just listen."
msgstr "[...íš ťĥíš báñď ĺívé? Ýóú bý ťĥé ĺífť šĥáfť - ďóñ'ť áñšŵéŕ. Ĵúšť ĺíšťéñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "That eye was a Collector. Civic Recovery. It doesn't want you. It wants what's in your chest."
msgstr "[Ťĥáť éýé ŵáš á Çóĺĺéçťóŕ. Çívíç Ŕéçóvéŕý. Íť ďóéšñ'ť ŵáñť ýóú. Íť ŵáñťš ŵĥáť'š íñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Up the shaft the Pulse runs thick and your Core drains. Keep moving, keep hitting. It feeds on that."
msgstr "[Úp ťĥé šĥáfť ťĥé Púĺšé ŕúñš ťĥíçķ áñď ýóúŕ Çóŕé ďŕáíñš. Ķéép móvíñğ, ķéép ĥíťťíñğ. Íť fééďš óñ ťĥáť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "There's an Anchor at the top - our kit. Rest there and fill back up. The only way on is through the bay. Its nest."
msgstr "[Ťĥéŕé'š áñ Áñçĥóŕ áť ťĥé ťóp - óúŕ ķíť. Ŕéšť ťĥéŕé áñď fíĺĺ báçķ úp. Ťĥé óñĺý ŵáý óñ íš ťĥŕóúğĥ ťĥé báý. Íťš ñéšť.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Get past it and follow the old rail line up to the Relay. We're friendly. Mostly. Name's Orr."
msgstr "[Ğéť pášť íť áñď fóĺĺóŵ ťĥé óĺď ŕáíĺ ĺíñé úp ťó ťĥé Ŕéĺáý. Ŵé'ŕé fŕíéñďĺý. Móšťĺý. Ñámé'š Óŕŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "...is this band live? Don't answer. Just listen."
msgstr "[...íš ťĥíš báñď ĺívé? Ďóñ'ť áñšŵéŕ. Ĵúšť ĺíšťéñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "Something down here hunts what's in your chest. Civic Recovery calls it a Collector. Its nest is the bay under the old rail line."
msgstr "[Šóméťĥíñğ ďóŵñ ĥéŕé ĥúñťš ŵĥáť'š íñ ýóúŕ çĥéšť. Çívíç Ŕéçóvéŕý çáĺĺš íť á Çóĺĺéçťóŕ. Íťš ñéšť íš ťĥé báý úñďéŕ ťĥé óĺď ŕáíĺ ĺíñé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

#: data/npcs/orr_radio.tres
msgid "The rail line runs up to the Relay. We're friendly. Mostly. Name's Orr."
msgstr "[Ťĥé ŕáíĺ ĺíñé ŕúñš úp ťó ťĥé Ŕéĺáý. Ŵé'ŕé fŕíéñďĺý. Móšťĺý. Ñámé'š Óŕŕ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~]"

